WEBVTT

01:29.230 --> 01:34.360
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.810 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 17]

01:39.479 --> 01:40.150
Yes.

01:41.400 --> 01:42.700
She really thinks after all these years

01:42.700 --> 01:43.780
away from Lanyue,

01:44.120 --> 01:45.759
she can just come back, flap her lips,

01:45.759 --> 01:47.289
and fix everything?

01:49.000 --> 01:50.310
What a joke.

01:51.710 --> 01:52.710
I know.

01:53.509 --> 01:55.280
With the phase one's current results,

01:55.280 --> 01:56.479
nobody's forgetting

01:56.509 --> 01:58.200
who exactly built it up,

01:58.360 --> 01:59.000
right?

01:59.590 --> 02:01.320
She wants to. Who doesn't?

02:01.510 --> 02:03.640
But it depends on whether I'm willing.

02:05.590 --> 02:06.230
Alright.

02:06.290 --> 02:07.690
I've got something else.

02:08.340 --> 02:09.410
Okay. Bye.

02:12.030 --> 02:12.750
Come in.

02:18.670 --> 02:19.870
What brings you here?

02:21.550 --> 02:22.880
I'm here to return this.

02:26.090 --> 02:26.910
After this summer vacation,

02:26.910 --> 02:27.970
I'll go to Beijing.

02:28.450 --> 02:29.329
My mother and I

02:29.880 --> 02:31.790
shouldn't keep in touch
with the Lu family anymore.

02:31.790 --> 02:33.520
And I can't accept your things.

02:33.829 --> 02:36.280
Besides, I don't need it.

02:38.280 --> 02:39.440
You came all this way

02:40.350 --> 02:40.920
just to

02:40.920 --> 02:41.829
tell me that?

02:48.230 --> 02:48.829
Sit.

02:49.510 --> 02:50.160
Sit.

02:57.070 --> 02:58.230
You applied

02:59.510 --> 03:01.280
for computer science, right?

03:05.070 --> 03:07.280
You should switch to architecture.

03:08.670 --> 03:09.830
I'll get it done.

03:10.760 --> 03:11.880
Don't worry

03:12.790 --> 03:14.230
about the money either.

03:14.790 --> 03:15.600
Okay?

03:17.200 --> 03:18.760
I know you and your mom

03:18.760 --> 03:20.720
have had a tough time

03:20.720 --> 03:22.040
all these years.

03:22.720 --> 03:23.890
But who am I?

03:24.790 --> 03:27.040
I'm your biological father.

03:28.350 --> 03:29.510
How could I not know

03:29.510 --> 03:31.320
what you really want to study?

03:34.160 --> 03:35.070
So what?

03:36.000 --> 03:36.600
If you really

03:36.600 --> 03:37.860
cared about our lives,

03:38.670 --> 03:39.550
things wouldn't have

03:39.550 --> 03:40.750
turned out like this.

03:41.920 --> 03:43.350
You were young back then.

03:43.350 --> 03:44.550
You didn't understand.

03:44.550 --> 03:45.320
You had no idea

03:45.320 --> 03:46.920
what was going on.

03:48.040 --> 03:48.440
You used to—

03:48.440 --> 03:50.480
Alright, alright.

03:50.480 --> 03:51.200
Son,

03:51.920 --> 03:53.670
we don't have to fight

03:53.670 --> 03:55.630
about right and wrong today.

03:55.630 --> 03:56.480
The past

03:56.480 --> 03:57.720
is the past.

03:57.950 --> 03:59.770
What you need to focus on

03:59.880 --> 04:01.720
now is your future.

04:03.760 --> 04:04.760
You got into Huaqing University

04:04.760 --> 04:06.320
relying on your own ability.

04:06.320 --> 04:07.120
So from now on,

04:07.200 --> 04:09.390
you need to study even harder.

04:10.500 --> 04:12.240
Don't end up

04:13.000 --> 04:14.000
like Xixiao,

04:14.000 --> 04:15.880
throwing away your future

04:15.880 --> 04:17.720
over some little romance.

04:20.230 --> 04:21.519
You're a man now.

04:22.870 --> 04:24.400
Grown up.

04:26.790 --> 04:27.990
Let me tell you,

04:28.280 --> 04:30.350
a career is more important

04:30.720 --> 04:33.480
to a man than his own life.

04:37.990 --> 04:39.310
This pen

04:42.110 --> 04:44.280
is something I had specially

04:44.280 --> 04:45.750
customized for you.

04:45.750 --> 04:47.750
It even has your name engraved on it.

04:48.870 --> 04:49.670
Take it.

04:50.230 --> 04:51.400
I believe one day,

04:52.190 --> 04:53.670
you'll find a use for it.

04:57.280 --> 04:59.280
I knew you were a good kid.

05:02.280 --> 05:02.870
Here,

05:04.990 --> 05:05.840
have a drink.

05:06.990 --> 05:07.600
No.

05:09.080 --> 05:09.990
You're an adult now.

05:09.990 --> 05:10.600
Take it.

05:10.600 --> 05:11.280
Try it.

05:13.550 --> 05:14.160
Here.

05:15.750 --> 05:17.190
I wish you a smooth

05:17.550 --> 05:19.080
career ahead.

05:20.190 --> 05:20.790
Cheers.

05:39.550 --> 05:40.350
Are you okay?

05:40.400 --> 05:41.550
What's going on? What happened?

05:41.550 --> 05:42.430
Might be a fire.

05:42.520 --> 05:43.650
Please come with us.

05:44.400 --> 05:45.080
Shouldn't you two

05:45.080 --> 05:46.610
go check on your boss first?

05:47.400 --> 05:48.310
Hurry up.

05:48.530 --> 05:49.060
Let's go.

06:08.750 --> 06:09.400
Mr. Lu.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.640
What's going on?

06:10.640 --> 06:11.600
We don't know yet.

06:11.600 --> 06:12.190
But we've already

06:12.190 --> 06:13.310
called the fire department.

06:13.310 --> 06:14.710
You should get out first.

06:18.920 --> 06:19.980
Where's Lu Xixiao?

06:20.720 --> 06:21.970
Where is Lu Xixiao?

06:22.160 --> 06:22.790
He...

06:25.190 --> 06:25.750
Let's go.

06:31.920 --> 06:32.770
Find Xixiao.

06:34.190 --> 06:34.960
Find him!

06:35.560 --> 06:36.650
Xixiao!

06:37.600 --> 06:38.640
Find Xixiao!

06:40.350 --> 06:41.310
Xixiao!

06:42.430 --> 06:43.750
Zhou Wan, you're crazy.

06:43.750 --> 06:45.150
Let's run away together.

06:45.540 --> 06:46.220
Lu Xixiao.

07:42.750 --> 07:44.150
Quick, stop here. Hurry.

07:44.720 --> 07:45.740
You two go that way.

07:45.740 --> 07:46.870
-This way!
-You two go there!

07:46.870 --> 07:47.870
You, come with me!

07:49.640 --> 07:50.840
Still haven't found Xixiao.

07:50.840 --> 07:52.230
Maybe he slipped away.

07:52.480 --> 07:52.920
But

07:52.920 --> 07:54.670
I spotted Miss Zhou on the surveillance

07:54.670 --> 07:56.720
before the power went out.

08:02.150 --> 08:03.530
Keep looking!

08:03.900 --> 08:05.600
Airport, train station—wherever!

08:05.600 --> 08:06.750
You must find them!

08:06.780 --> 08:07.550
You hear me?

08:08.160 --> 08:08.640
Yes, sir.

08:08.640 --> 08:09.750
Find Lu Xixiao!

08:09.750 --> 08:11.550
And bring that Zhou Wan back too!

08:11.990 --> 08:13.080
Go!

08:19.160 --> 08:21.160
This has nothing to do with Zhou Wan.

08:26.870 --> 08:27.800
What do you mean?

08:32.000 --> 08:33.880
So you coming to see me...

08:35.700 --> 08:37.990
today was a setup.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.880
Your real goal was to help Zhou Wan,

08:39.880 --> 08:40.640
wasn't it?

08:48.120 --> 08:49.830
Though cutting ties with the Lu family—

08:49.830 --> 08:50.760
that part

08:51.430 --> 08:52.560
wasn't a lie either.

08:53.880 --> 08:55.280
You know what I'm going

08:55.280 --> 08:56.830
to lose because of this?

09:10.360 --> 09:11.710
Well played, Jiang Yan.

09:12.280 --> 09:13.640
I really shouldn't have

09:13.640 --> 09:15.310
treated you like a kid.

09:19.920 --> 09:21.040
Tomorrow,

09:22.360 --> 09:24.890
Mr. Chang, who runs
a home furnishings brand,

09:25.640 --> 09:27.500
is hosting a family dinner for me.

09:28.950 --> 09:30.400
Compared to Xixiao,

09:31.790 --> 09:33.450
I think you're more qualified

09:33.460 --> 09:35.470
to come with me

09:35.640 --> 09:37.190
as my son.

09:43.280 --> 09:44.640
You're only asking me

09:45.520 --> 09:46.980
because he's gone, right?

09:48.120 --> 09:49.550
You should see it as—

09:49.900 --> 09:51.690
Lu Xixiao's failure

09:51.710 --> 09:52.830
has given you

09:53.670 --> 09:55.710
a chance to prove yourself.

09:58.550 --> 09:59.400
What if I don't want

09:59.400 --> 10:00.310
this chance?

10:09.830 --> 10:13.190
I'll come pick you up tomorrow.

10:30.360 --> 10:33.990
[Ticket Office]

10:32.360 --> 10:33.290
Wait for me here.

10:34.520 --> 10:35.920
Hi. Two tickets, please.

10:35.950 --> 10:36.550
Where to?

10:37.120 --> 10:38.450
We're going to see snow.

10:39.070 --> 10:40.400
The next train leaves in 10 minutes.

10:40.400 --> 10:41.160
Standing room only.

10:41.160 --> 10:41.890
That's fine.

10:46.890 --> 10:54.940
[Ticket Office]

10:59.980 --> 11:01.560
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

11:03.120 --> 11:04.910
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

11:07.920 --> 11:09.620
♪ I think you would understand ♪

11:11.330 --> 11:13.640
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

11:15.860 --> 11:17.990
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

11:19.290 --> 11:21.740
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

11:22.940 --> 11:25.410
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

11:26.530 --> 11:28.270
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

11:31.970 --> 11:33.670
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

11:35.410 --> 11:36.940
♪ An astronomer ♪

11:39.870 --> 11:41.540
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

11:43.350 --> 11:45.800
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

11:47.900 --> 11:49.900
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

11:51.400 --> 11:53.590
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

11:54.920 --> 11:57.410
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

11:58.840 --> 12:02.830
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

12:05.740 --> 12:07.170
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

12:06.000 --> 12:08.070
Beer, drinks, mineral water!

12:07.830 --> 12:09.380
♪ No time left, so I ♪

12:08.400 --> 12:10.280
Peanuts, sunflower seeds, grilled fish!

12:09.820 --> 12:12.130
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

12:11.670 --> 12:13.530
Coming through. Legs in, please!

12:13.800 --> 12:16.490
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

12:16.640 --> 12:20.300
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

12:21.930 --> 12:24.560
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

12:24.660 --> 12:28.380
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

12:28.260 --> 12:29.590
I had a beautiful dream.

12:30.220 --> 12:31.390
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

12:31.420 --> 12:34.120
♪ This mud all over me ♪

12:31.560 --> 12:32.620
What kind of dream?

12:34.000 --> 12:35.310
One as beautiful as me.

12:35.270 --> 12:37.880
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

12:40.190 --> 12:40.790
Look.

12:58.140 --> 12:59.600
♪ I can't remember and can't go back ♪

12:59.670 --> 13:01.740
♪ If you can't hold it tightly, let me ♪

13:01.820 --> 13:03.800
♪ Fly without hesitation ♪

13:05.820 --> 13:08.500
♪ Sorry, I'm too capricious and obsessed ♪

13:08.960 --> 13:12.180
♪ The Milky Way is drowning ♪

13:13.910 --> 13:16.550
♪ If one day you fall into ♪

13:16.630 --> 13:20.970
♪ The gap a light-year away ♪

13:23.730 --> 13:25.430
♪ You'll find ♪

13:25.640 --> 13:27.880
♪ The scattered ashes ♪

13:29.320 --> 13:34.920
♪ Burns my heart ♪

13:44.850 --> 13:50.680
[Beicheng]

13:55.370 --> 13:56.130
Thank you.

14:12.790 --> 14:13.720
I'm going to eat.

14:27.790 --> 14:28.310
Three—

14:28.310 --> 14:29.250
Two, one!

14:29.430 --> 14:30.790
You didn't say two, one!

14:31.670 --> 14:32.430
You cheated.

14:32.590 --> 14:34.190
You cheated. You're a cheat.

14:37.950 --> 14:39.790
Be careful, you'll break it.

14:40.280 --> 14:41.510
You started it.

14:41.780 --> 14:42.880
-I took it all apart.
-My fault.

14:42.880 --> 14:44.010
I'm going to assemble.

14:44.010 --> 14:44.640
Assembling now.

14:44.640 --> 14:45.520
The body's gotta come off first. The body—

14:45.520 --> 14:47.160
I-I already took it all apart.

14:47.160 --> 14:47.590
Done.

14:48.830 --> 14:49.920
What does this mean?

14:49.920 --> 14:51.040
I put it back together.

14:51.040 --> 14:52.770
Take it apart, then put it back.

14:53.870 --> 14:55.200
That's not how you play?

14:55.360 --> 14:56.070
Did you even take it apart?

14:56.070 --> 14:56.590
I did.

14:56.590 --> 14:58.240
I just poured everything out.

14:58.240 --> 14:59.570
Wanna see the playback?

15:03.040 --> 15:04.100
I took it all apart.

15:08.040 --> 15:08.710
Tear it open,

15:08.710 --> 15:10.110
then tuck it in like this.

15:14.880 --> 15:15.680
What's wrong?

15:16.640 --> 15:17.970
It's stuck?

15:18.240 --> 15:19.040
Wait.

15:19.160 --> 15:19.950
Wait, wait.

15:19.950 --> 15:20.830
Don't rush.

15:20.830 --> 15:22.180
Don't yank it.

15:22.880 --> 15:23.950
Don't—don't do that.

15:23.950 --> 15:24.790
How about this?

15:24.790 --> 15:25.640
Let's go.

15:26.670 --> 15:27.680
Come on, I'll carry it.

15:27.680 --> 15:30.480
There's a supermarket ahead.
I'll take you there.

16:02.420 --> 16:03.190
Congratulations!

16:03.190 --> 16:04.390
Congrats to you both.

16:05.320 --> 16:06.450
The bride and groom.

16:07.160 --> 16:08.280
Tomorrow, bride,

16:08.280 --> 16:09.000
you'll walk in

16:09.000 --> 16:10.170
through this door.

16:10.240 --> 16:13.640
-Groom, you'll hold out the bouquet,
-It's like a fairy tale.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.720
then take her hand.

16:15.950 --> 16:16.920
In fairy tales,

16:16.920 --> 16:17.830
the male and female lead

16:17.830 --> 16:19.590
go through all kinds of trials,

16:20.070 --> 16:22.070
and finally got together in the end.

16:23.400 --> 16:25.070
It's a wonderful ending.

16:25.070 --> 16:25.880
Do you

16:25.880 --> 16:27.240
take this woman

16:27.240 --> 16:28.100
to be your wife?

16:28.120 --> 16:28.880
I do.

16:31.240 --> 16:31.880
Okay.

16:32.310 --> 16:34.730
Whether rich or poor,

16:34.790 --> 16:35.760
in sickness or in health...

16:35.760 --> 16:37.280
Even though this isn't

16:38.280 --> 16:40.030
our ending right now...

16:40.550 --> 16:41.430
I do.

16:41.880 --> 16:42.580
Okay.

16:42.830 --> 16:44.590
I'm already so happy.

16:47.470 --> 16:48.360
Me too.

16:49.950 --> 16:50.400
Okay.

16:50.830 --> 16:51.710
After that...

16:52.430 --> 16:54.160
I have something to tell you.

16:54.280 --> 16:54.810
Go ahead.

16:59.400 --> 17:00.920
Let's date, Lu Xixiao.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.569
Let's date, Lu Xixiao.

17:09.670 --> 17:11.030
I want to be with you.

17:12.030 --> 17:13.030
Lu Xixiao.

17:17.880 --> 17:18.430
Okay.

17:21.849 --> 17:27.400
♪ The narcissus rides a carp,
drifting away in sadness ♪

17:28.970 --> 17:34.530
♪ Deep green lurks beneath the sea,
stirring the nebula ♪

17:36.190 --> 17:42.010
♪ On countless nights, we move forward ♪

17:43.310 --> 17:45.490
♪ Seeking, waking up and collecting ♪

17:46.980 --> 17:48.970
♪ Crazy love ♪

17:50.070 --> 17:54.950
♪ Say yes, let's start fresh ♪

17:57.870 --> 18:00.220
♪ The first night, my sunset ♪

18:00.440 --> 18:04.000
♪ The whole world, the two of us♪

18:04.110 --> 18:07.400
♪ The city doesn't sleep, ups and downs ♪

18:07.240 --> 18:07.890
Groom,

18:07.570 --> 18:11.170
♪ Breathing at midnight ♪

18:07.950 --> 18:09.320
do you take

18:09.320 --> 18:10.780
this woman to be your wife?

18:10.840 --> 18:11.670
I do!

18:12.190 --> 18:14.090
Whether rich or poor,

18:12.520 --> 18:14.900
♪ Someone lights the fire ♪

18:14.230 --> 18:16.320
until death do you part—

18:15.000 --> 18:18.650
♪ The love burns each other ♪

18:16.400 --> 18:17.640
do you promise?

18:17.640 --> 18:18.950
I do.

18:18.920 --> 18:21.730
♪ My organs ♪

18:19.030 --> 18:21.030
Bride, do you promise?

18:22.170 --> 18:25.560
♪ Every midnight ♪

18:24.800 --> 18:25.560
I do.

18:25.760 --> 18:28.630
♪ Being played ♪

18:26.510 --> 18:26.990
Okay.

18:27.230 --> 18:28.990
Groom, please kneel on one knee

18:28.990 --> 18:31.120
and present your bouquet to the bride.

18:55.990 --> 18:56.920
Alright, bride,

18:56.990 --> 18:58.430
you may help the groom up.

19:01.510 --> 19:02.190
Applause!

19:07.560 --> 19:08.640
But you know what?

19:11.190 --> 19:12.270
All fairy tales

19:12.270 --> 19:13.160
are fake.

19:25.300 --> 19:30.540
[Princess Lily]

19:25.800 --> 19:26.470
Grandma.

19:26.640 --> 19:28.470
In the storybook, the prince and princess

19:28.470 --> 19:29.130
lived

19:29.160 --> 19:30.470
happily ever after.

19:30.710 --> 19:31.640
Is that true?

19:32.400 --> 19:35.130
What's written in the book
should be true, right?

19:42.270 --> 19:43.510
Isn't this just emotional blackmail?

19:43.510 --> 19:46.840
Mom, don't leave me.

19:47.360 --> 19:48.840
The factory's in trouble.

19:49.030 --> 19:51.490
Why do you have to be
the one to take the blame?

19:52.120 --> 19:54.670
What about the promises
you made before we got married?

19:54.670 --> 19:55.860
What did you say?

19:56.640 --> 19:57.840
You said after we got married,

19:57.840 --> 19:59.160
we'd have a good life.

19:59.160 --> 20:00.400
I wouldn't have to do anything

20:00.400 --> 20:01.510
or worry about anything.

20:01.510 --> 20:03.160
We'd live in a big house.

20:03.160 --> 20:03.710
Isn't that

20:03.710 --> 20:04.880
what you told me?

20:06.080 --> 20:06.990
I believe our family

20:06.990 --> 20:08.430
can get through this.

20:09.120 --> 20:10.120
All these years,

20:10.750 --> 20:11.360
I have been

20:11.360 --> 20:13.090
doing all this for the factory.

20:13.770 --> 20:18.140
[Princess Lily]

20:14.640 --> 20:15.710
Are all

20:15.880 --> 20:17.430
fairy tales really lies?

20:18.670 --> 20:19.270
Yes.

20:19.510 --> 20:21.120
Fairy tales are all lies.

21:17.800 --> 21:18.600
Mr. Chang.

21:18.950 --> 21:19.580
Mr. Lu.

21:19.800 --> 21:20.190
Welcome.

21:20.190 --> 21:21.810
Sorry to keep you waiting.

21:22.030 --> 21:22.950
Not at all.

21:25.670 --> 21:26.470
Come here.

21:27.510 --> 21:28.840
My son here

21:29.340 --> 21:30.580
is just a bit shy

21:30.600 --> 21:31.750
and introverted.

21:31.800 --> 21:33.670
This is the one
who got into Huaqing University, right?

21:33.670 --> 21:34.160
Yes.

21:34.400 --> 21:35.030
Good.

21:35.030 --> 21:36.510
Truly outstanding.

21:37.120 --> 21:38.580
You're a lucky man, Mr. Lu.

21:38.600 --> 21:39.400
Have a seat.

21:39.400 --> 21:40.270
Okay. Come.

21:41.190 --> 21:41.920
Have a seat.

21:56.080 --> 21:56.630
Did you see

21:56.630 --> 21:58.060
Mr. Chang's look today?

22:01.840 --> 22:02.670
Son,

22:03.320 --> 22:04.840
you did great.

22:04.840 --> 22:07.170
Mr. Chang said he really appreciates you.

22:09.710 --> 22:11.170
He's just flattering you.

22:13.270 --> 22:15.160
Running his business

22:15.160 --> 22:16.670
on such a large scale,

22:16.670 --> 22:18.400
does he need to flatter anyone?

22:18.800 --> 22:20.080
And Mr. Chang is a man

22:20.140 --> 22:21.380
of his word.

22:21.400 --> 22:22.430
I've never seen him

22:22.430 --> 22:23.800
flatter Lu Xixiao.

22:24.560 --> 22:25.190
Did you notice?

22:25.190 --> 22:26.750
When you talked about

22:27.400 --> 22:29.560
integrating home furnishings

22:29.560 --> 22:31.090
with real estate concepts—

22:31.160 --> 22:32.400
the way he looked at you?

22:32.400 --> 22:34.320
His eyes were shining.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.930
He appreciates you so much.

22:35.990 --> 22:37.190
He probably wishes you were

22:37.190 --> 22:38.950
part of his family right now.

22:42.880 --> 22:43.940
What a pity for him.

22:44.190 --> 22:45.470
You'll always

22:45.470 --> 22:47.120
be my son.

22:50.920 --> 22:52.190
Since he's satisfied,

22:52.470 --> 22:53.510
we're even now.

22:54.920 --> 22:56.400
What do you mean

22:56.400 --> 22:57.670
by "even"?

22:58.190 --> 22:59.990
Am I not your biological father?

23:00.800 --> 23:02.120
Everything I'm doing for you now

23:02.120 --> 23:03.190
is to pave the way

23:03.190 --> 23:04.470
for your future,

23:04.990 --> 23:05.800
isn't it?

23:06.800 --> 23:09.190
Come visit more often,

23:09.430 --> 23:11.160
and have dinner with me.

23:11.470 --> 23:12.270
Okay?

23:13.270 --> 23:14.030
Brat.

23:18.470 --> 23:19.190
Secretary,

23:20.230 --> 23:21.640
tell the housekeeper

23:21.640 --> 23:22.640
to prepare some good dishes.

23:22.640 --> 23:24.520
I'm having a proper drink

23:25.030 --> 23:26.190
with my son tonight.

23:26.710 --> 23:28.120
O-Okay.

23:28.120 --> 23:29.120
Mr. Lu.

23:29.640 --> 23:31.160
No need. I'm going home.

23:32.920 --> 23:34.030
Why are you going home?

23:34.030 --> 23:35.750
Isn't my home your home?

23:36.750 --> 23:38.710
Just stay at home.

23:39.430 --> 23:41.900
M-Mr. Lu, we're heading off now.

23:41.920 --> 23:43.190
Please buckle up.

23:59.510 --> 24:00.360
Hello, sir.

24:01.230 --> 24:02.430
I'd like to get a room.

24:02.430 --> 24:03.890
Okay. Checking in, right?

24:06.950 --> 24:07.840
One room.

24:10.990 --> 24:11.670
A deluxe queen room

24:11.670 --> 24:12.920
is 498 yuan per night.

24:15.430 --> 24:16.560
Two standard rooms.

24:16.800 --> 24:18.360
The standard room is 300 yuan per night.

24:18.360 --> 24:19.360
Two rooms, right?

24:19.400 --> 24:20.710
Okay. ID, please.

24:23.030 --> 24:23.950
Can I pay with card?

24:23.950 --> 24:24.750
Yes, you can.

24:26.430 --> 24:27.080
Sorry, sir.

24:27.080 --> 24:28.340
This card's declined.

24:31.030 --> 24:31.640
Declined?

24:31.640 --> 24:32.430
Yes.

24:35.710 --> 24:36.320
Try this one.

24:36.320 --> 24:36.750
Okay.

24:39.880 --> 24:41.320
This one's declined too.

24:44.750 --> 24:46.080
Your cards have been...

24:49.460 --> 24:50.360
It's fine.

24:51.030 --> 24:52.080
I still have cash.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.990
But we probably can't afford

24:53.990 --> 24:55.320
a hotel this expensive.

24:55.800 --> 24:57.530
Let's think of something else.

25:00.840 --> 25:02.100
Go out and look around.

25:04.230 --> 25:05.690
As long as we're together.

25:06.640 --> 25:07.190
Yes.

25:07.560 --> 25:08.960
That's all that matters.

25:11.510 --> 25:12.400
I'm sorry.

25:12.430 --> 25:13.270
It's okay.

25:16.800 --> 25:17.470
Please.

25:17.670 --> 25:18.190
Okay.

25:18.470 --> 25:19.710
What's the school situation

25:19.710 --> 25:20.710
like around here?

25:20.840 --> 25:22.220
I'm planning on a long-term rental.

25:22.220 --> 25:24.190
My kid's taking the high school
entrance exam next year,

25:24.190 --> 25:24.950
so I have to

25:24.950 --> 25:26.030
think about that.

25:26.030 --> 25:27.430
Right. That's a big deal.

25:27.840 --> 25:29.170
Where did you run off to?

25:29.710 --> 25:31.370
Why are you dressed like that?

25:31.400 --> 25:32.750
I accompanied my teacher to an event.

25:32.750 --> 25:33.880
Needed formal wear.

25:33.920 --> 25:34.700
The food's in the kitchen.

25:34.700 --> 25:35.950
Go eat something.

25:36.030 --> 25:36.920
I already ate.

25:38.670 --> 25:41.670
You have all the gold medals.

25:41.670 --> 25:42.560
That's amazing.

25:42.560 --> 25:43.030
Yes.

25:43.600 --> 25:44.640
No. 3 High School and No. 2 High School

25:44.640 --> 25:45.720
are both nearby.

25:45.990 --> 25:46.990
Yangming High School

25:46.990 --> 25:48.640
is also top-tier.

25:49.120 --> 25:50.400
My son just graduated

25:50.400 --> 25:51.920
from Yangming High School this year.

25:51.920 --> 25:52.640
Really?

25:52.670 --> 25:54.530
Which university did he get into?

25:55.360 --> 25:56.750
He didn't take the exam.

25:57.310 --> 25:59.310
He won a national competition prize

25:59.560 --> 26:01.990
and got early admission
to Huaqing University.

26:01.990 --> 26:04.070
He must be the top scorer, then?

26:04.880 --> 26:05.950
He didn't take the exam,

26:05.950 --> 26:06.830
so no score.

26:07.160 --> 26:08.670
How could he be the top scorer?

26:08.670 --> 26:10.440
That's even more impressive!

26:10.670 --> 26:11.800
Why didn't you say so earlier?

26:11.800 --> 26:12.640
This house

26:12.640 --> 26:13.950
is a treasure place!

26:13.950 --> 26:14.840
We can soak up

26:14.840 --> 26:16.100
some of that good luck.

26:17.190 --> 26:18.360
This room

26:18.430 --> 26:19.640
has the best lighting

26:19.640 --> 26:20.840
in the whole house.

26:20.990 --> 26:22.430
Cool in summer, warm in winter.

26:22.430 --> 26:23.950
It's great

26:23.950 --> 26:25.210
for the kid's eyes too.

26:26.430 --> 26:27.360
My son's about to

26:27.360 --> 26:28.640
leave for university.

26:29.210 --> 26:30.400
The days we have together

26:30.400 --> 26:31.470
are getting fewer.

26:31.670 --> 26:33.990
If I weren't trying to
spend more time with him,

26:33.990 --> 26:34.800
I wouldn't even

26:34.800 --> 26:35.750
rent out my own

26:35.750 --> 26:36.640
house.

26:37.670 --> 26:38.930
So many certificates!

26:40.360 --> 26:41.120
You've done

26:41.120 --> 26:42.650
an amazing job raising him.

26:42.840 --> 26:43.710
He has trophies too,

26:43.710 --> 26:45.160
not just certificates.

26:45.160 --> 26:46.270
He's exceptional.

26:46.270 --> 26:47.730
This house is not for rent.

26:48.880 --> 26:49.400
Wh-

26:49.490 --> 26:50.060
What?

26:50.080 --> 26:52.140
My son's a little reluctant to leave.

26:52.430 --> 26:53.270
Don't worry, son.

26:53.270 --> 26:54.120
We'll rent a better

26:54.120 --> 26:55.120
place in Beijing.

26:55.510 --> 26:56.920
After you graduate and start working—

26:56.920 --> 26:58.720
I said this house is not for rent!

26:58.800 --> 27:00.200
Do you not understand me?

27:01.600 --> 27:02.750
Have you ever asked

27:02.750 --> 27:03.800
what I think?

27:04.750 --> 27:06.150
Do you even care about me?

27:07.640 --> 27:08.990
Am I your son or not?

27:12.160 --> 27:12.800
Get out.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.160
Get out!

27:15.800 --> 27:16.670
Get out!

27:17.470 --> 27:18.230
I...

27:18.230 --> 27:19.080
-I'm leaving.
-I'm so sorry.

27:19.080 --> 27:20.710
Maybe take another look.

27:20.710 --> 27:21.320
No.

27:21.320 --> 27:22.560
Go take your son to see a doctor.

27:22.560 --> 27:23.360
He has issues.

27:23.560 --> 27:24.890
I'm really sorry.

27:51.120 --> 27:52.120
Why?

27:54.230 --> 27:55.490
Why?

27:57.950 --> 27:58.990
Why?

28:07.990 --> 28:09.320
I didn't have time

28:09.320 --> 28:10.880
to take your measurements,

28:11.190 --> 28:12.560
so I just brought one of

28:12.600 --> 28:13.640
Xixiao's outfits.

28:13.640 --> 28:15.640
Try it on. See if it fits.

28:33.400 --> 28:34.470
Lu Xixiao.

28:35.360 --> 28:36.400
Why am I always

28:36.400 --> 28:38.570
just your replacement?

28:47.510 --> 28:49.040
Come on, eat while it's hot.

28:49.920 --> 28:51.400
Taste the goodness.

28:56.920 --> 28:57.710
With this money,

28:57.710 --> 28:59.400
we can hold out a while longer.

29:00.640 --> 29:01.400
We'll have to

29:01.400 --> 29:03.050
budget carefully.

29:04.030 --> 29:05.760
The trees here are still green.

29:06.190 --> 29:07.270
Probably won't snow

29:07.270 --> 29:08.670
anytime soon.

29:09.120 --> 29:09.750
We'll need to keep

29:09.750 --> 29:10.840
heading north.

29:11.080 --> 29:11.940
Further north?

29:12.920 --> 29:13.880
Which way is north?

29:13.880 --> 29:14.670
That way.

29:16.160 --> 29:16.840
That way?

29:16.990 --> 29:18.430
Come on, let's go north.

29:28.030 --> 29:28.510
Sir.

29:29.160 --> 29:29.890
Fixing bikes?

29:29.890 --> 29:30.960
You got any

29:31.120 --> 29:32.270
used motorcycles?

29:32.400 --> 29:33.160
Used ones?

29:33.710 --> 29:34.600
Over there. That whole

29:34.600 --> 29:35.470
pile is used.

29:36.320 --> 29:36.950
All of it?

29:38.190 --> 29:39.710
You want something this beat up?

29:39.710 --> 29:40.270
No.

29:40.950 --> 29:42.230
If I can fix one up,

29:42.320 --> 29:43.470
can I get it cheaper?

29:43.750 --> 29:44.810
Pretty confident.

29:45.230 --> 29:46.060
I was going to strip these

29:46.060 --> 29:47.150
for parts.

29:47.320 --> 29:48.850
If you can actually fix one,

29:48.920 --> 29:50.050
I'll sell it at cost.

29:50.750 --> 29:51.360
Deal?

29:53.710 --> 29:54.400
Have a look.

29:56.230 --> 29:56.840
Sir.

29:57.130 --> 29:59.010
How much did you pay for this?

29:59.160 --> 30:00.360
I paid scrap price.

30:00.360 --> 30:01.270
200 yuan.

30:02.880 --> 30:04.120
But you were going to

30:04.120 --> 30:05.270
recycle it anyway.

30:05.600 --> 30:06.600
If we can fix it,

30:06.600 --> 30:07.030
can you

30:07.030 --> 30:08.360
knock a little more off?

30:08.640 --> 30:09.360
Miss,

30:09.430 --> 30:10.510
I've got costs too.

30:10.510 --> 30:12.080
200 is already rock bottom.

30:12.630 --> 30:14.180
Please.

30:14.340 --> 30:15.650
Just 50 less.

30:15.670 --> 30:16.360
50.

30:16.360 --> 30:17.080
Fine.

30:17.080 --> 30:17.880
Then can you

30:17.880 --> 30:19.610
throw in two cans of fuel for us?

30:20.750 --> 30:21.120
Alright.

30:21.120 --> 30:22.450
If you really can fix it,

30:22.800 --> 30:24.460
I'll give you two cans of fuel.

30:24.800 --> 30:25.230
Okay?

30:25.230 --> 30:26.320
Okay. Thank you.

30:26.320 --> 30:27.180
Thank you, sir.

30:28.360 --> 30:28.820
That...

30:28.880 --> 30:29.790
That was quick.

30:31.160 --> 30:31.950
That's not the one.

30:31.950 --> 30:32.920
Thank you, sir!

30:32.920 --> 30:33.800
That's not the one!

30:33.800 --> 30:34.950
-Sir.
-Sir, you said it yourself.

30:34.950 --> 30:35.600
You said this one.

30:35.600 --> 30:37.080
-You said that pile over there.
-Isn't that all used motorcycles?

30:37.080 --> 30:38.080
Listen, listen to me.

30:38.080 --> 30:38.670
No, wait—

30:56.080 --> 30:57.890
♪ Give me some candlelight ♪

30:59.550 --> 31:01.310
♪ Let it illuminate his face ♪

31:02.550 --> 31:04.000
♪ if your voice is hoarse ♪

31:04.980 --> 31:07.210
♪ It'll lead to more imaginations ♪

31:08.390 --> 31:12.150
[300 km to Yicheng]

31:09.430 --> 31:10.800
♪ The warm night breeze ♪

31:12.820 --> 31:14.450
♪ Has filled the corridor ♪

31:16.020 --> 31:17.770
♪ Wet clothes ♪

31:18.810 --> 31:21.210
♪ Flowing waves ♪

31:22.910 --> 31:25.170
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

31:23.770 --> 31:27.630
[216 km to Yicheng]

31:26.300 --> 31:28.190
♪ Look away in the next second ♪

31:29.560 --> 31:31.090
♪ Tell a long joke ♪

31:33.060 --> 31:35.130
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

31:36.370 --> 31:38.850
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

31:39.540 --> 31:43.630
[128 km to Yicheng]

31:39.940 --> 31:42.040
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

31:43.510 --> 31:45.480
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

31:47.020 --> 31:48.650
♪ It's getting late ♪

31:50.370 --> 31:51.710
♪ His obsession ♪

31:53.830 --> 31:55.590
♪ Keep everything in mind ♪

31:57.020 --> 31:58.420
♪ The record is spinning ♪

31:59.610 --> 32:01.390
♪ Let me finish this cigarette ♪

32:03.850 --> 32:05.010
♪ Just stay here with me ♪

32:06.800 --> 32:10.870
[45 km to Yicheng]

32:07.190 --> 32:08.990
♪ Even if we just wander around ♪

32:10.560 --> 32:11.900
♪ And do nothing ♪

32:12.120 --> 32:13.530
Stop and go.

32:12.870 --> 32:13.790
♪ Go on a date with me ♪

32:14.800 --> 32:16.510
We'll just have fun wherever we end up.

32:14.840 --> 32:18.910
♪ On this Sunday night ♪

32:17.920 --> 32:18.670
But we do need

32:18.670 --> 32:19.800
to plan carefully.

32:20.430 --> 32:21.640
Even though we've

32:21.640 --> 32:22.640
got enough money

32:22.640 --> 32:24.340
between us to last a while,

32:24.470 --> 32:25.800
before that runs out,

32:25.800 --> 32:26.800
we should find a place

32:26.800 --> 32:28.470
where we can work for room and board.

32:28.470 --> 32:29.800
Work for room and board?

32:30.160 --> 32:31.160
What's that mean?

32:31.320 --> 32:33.160
Work for room and board? That's fine.

32:33.160 --> 32:33.710
But

32:33.780 --> 32:35.140
let me be clear up front.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.950
I'll provide three meals
and a place to sleep.

32:36.950 --> 32:38.080
But the place is a bit rough.

32:38.080 --> 32:39.560
You'll have to

32:39.560 --> 32:41.020
clean it up yourselves.

32:41.430 --> 32:42.160
Come in.

32:43.640 --> 32:44.880
There are two beds.

32:44.280 --> 32:46.540
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

32:44.910 --> 32:46.110
Exactly two beds.

32:46.840 --> 32:47.710
Perfect.

32:47.670 --> 32:49.630
♪ Look away in the next second ♪

32:47.710 --> 32:48.400
We can cook too.

32:48.400 --> 32:49.930
We can even cook here. Look.

32:50.840 --> 32:51.430
Not bad at all.

32:50.930 --> 32:52.600
♪ Tell a long joke ♪

32:51.430 --> 32:53.030
Ma'am, can we stay long-term?

32:53.030 --> 32:53.470
You can

32:53.470 --> 32:55.410
stay as long as you like.

32:54.420 --> 32:56.490
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

32:55.640 --> 32:57.190
But you have to think it over.

32:57.190 --> 32:57.710
This yard's been

32:57.710 --> 32:58.920
abandoned for a long time.

32:57.740 --> 33:01.020
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

32:59.270 --> 33:00.400
It'll take some work

33:00.400 --> 33:01.430
to fix up.

33:01.150 --> 33:03.880
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

33:04.380 --> 33:06.850
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

33:06.990 --> 33:08.600
Xixiao, help me see the guests out.

33:08.390 --> 33:10.170
♪ It's getting late ♪

33:08.840 --> 33:10.020
Sure. This way.

33:10.210 --> 33:11.130
Be careful.

33:11.300 --> 33:12.160
-The car is over here.
-Bye.

33:12.160 --> 33:13.320
Welcome to come again.

33:12.280 --> 33:13.320
♪ Will you come with me? ♪

33:13.320 --> 33:13.670
Come.

33:13.920 --> 33:15.190
How was it? Did you have fun?

33:15.190 --> 33:16.120
Yeah.

33:15.230 --> 33:17.050
♪ Faint echoes ♪

33:16.400 --> 33:17.360
Bye.

33:17.360 --> 33:18.840
Bye.

33:18.250 --> 33:19.490
♪ A yawn ♪

33:20.700 --> 33:23.140
♪ To hide the pretense of guilt ♪

33:21.560 --> 33:22.230
This puppy was left

33:22.230 --> 33:23.320
behind by a customer

33:23.320 --> 33:24.320
last time.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.450
♪ When dawn comes ♪

33:25.230 --> 33:26.470
Little puppy.

33:26.640 --> 33:27.430
You two are both

33:27.430 --> 33:28.310
so young.

33:28.430 --> 33:29.860
I was young once too.

33:28.740 --> 33:30.590
♪ Time flies ♪

33:30.270 --> 33:30.950
So you two

33:30.950 --> 33:32.320
should cherish each other,

33:32.320 --> 33:33.340
♪ Forget everything ♪

33:32.320 --> 33:34.190
and cherish this time together.

33:34.330 --> 33:35.200
♪ Could his thoughts ♪

33:34.400 --> 33:35.160
Shake hands.

33:36.170 --> 33:40.390
♪ Actually be the same as mine ♪

33:36.190 --> 33:37.710
-Shake hands.
-The noodles are ready, Zhou Wan.

33:37.710 --> 33:38.880
-Let's eat noodles.
-Shake hands.

33:38.880 --> 33:40.190
Just staring at it, not me.

33:40.190 --> 33:41.200
Aren't you?

33:41.400 --> 33:42.800
It kind of looks like you.

33:45.020 --> 33:46.400
It really does.

33:46.400 --> 33:47.270
Xiaojin.

33:47.920 --> 33:49.820
Xiaohuang.

33:50.320 --> 33:50.920
Xiaoliu.

33:51.980 --> 33:52.700
Xiaoliu?

33:53.510 --> 33:54.310
Zhou Xiaoliu.

33:54.560 --> 33:55.580
Zhou Xiaoliu!

33:55.600 --> 33:56.390
Zhou Xiaoliu!

33:56.390 --> 33:57.450
Zhou Xiaoliu.

33:57.480 --> 33:59.740
Zhou Xiaoliu!

34:00.670 --> 34:01.470
Cover up.

34:05.320 --> 34:06.980
Come try my cooking, Zhou Wan.

34:09.400 --> 34:11.380
Smells amazing.

34:11.550 --> 34:12.179
Eat up.

34:13.199 --> 34:14.199
Have some of this.

34:14.400 --> 34:15.400
Give me your bowl.

34:20.800 --> 34:21.360
How is it?

34:21.510 --> 34:24.170
Instant noodles are the best
at times like this.

34:31.110 --> 34:31.760
Refill.

34:33.590 --> 34:34.550
Why aren't you eating?

34:34.550 --> 34:35.199
I am.

34:35.199 --> 34:36.239
I'm eating this now.

34:36.239 --> 34:36.630
Go on.

34:36.630 --> 34:38.090
Go lean over there and eat.

34:41.239 --> 34:41.920
I heard

34:41.920 --> 34:44.179
it's still a while before the snow comes.

34:44.429 --> 34:45.989
I've already made a list of things

34:45.989 --> 34:47.630
we'll need over the next few days.

34:47.630 --> 34:48.590
Let's go to the supermarket

34:48.590 --> 34:49.320
and stock up.

34:51.630 --> 34:52.320
Sure.

34:54.429 --> 34:55.889
Let's grab some books too.

34:57.110 --> 34:57.840
Books?

34:58.630 --> 34:59.470
What for?

35:00.240 --> 35:01.360
I want to retake the exam.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.030
Retake?

35:04.110 --> 35:05.240
Why the sudden idea?

35:06.990 --> 35:08.120
Grandma always said

35:09.160 --> 35:10.890
she wanted me to go to college

35:11.200 --> 35:12.840
and see more of the world.

35:14.840 --> 35:17.990
I still want to fulfill her wish.

35:19.880 --> 35:20.550
Okay.

35:21.240 --> 35:21.950
No problem.

35:23.110 --> 35:23.590
What about you?

35:23.590 --> 35:24.950
Do you want to retake it with me?

35:24.950 --> 35:25.950
What's your plan?

35:26.550 --> 35:27.810
I'll follow your lead.

35:28.070 --> 35:29.330
You'll follow my lead?

35:34.150 --> 35:35.350
So you just follow me,

35:35.800 --> 35:37.030
and do whatever I say.

35:43.030 --> 35:44.230
Why are you laughing?

35:46.320 --> 35:47.380
I'm just thinking,

35:48.430 --> 35:49.720
seeing you plan our life

35:49.720 --> 35:50.720
like this now,

35:53.720 --> 35:54.590
you're totally gonna

35:54.590 --> 35:55.470
run my life.

35:57.680 --> 35:58.760
Who wants to do that?

35:58.760 --> 36:00.020
If you don't, who will?

36:01.430 --> 36:02.690
If you don't, who will?

36:04.150 --> 36:05.810
You've eaten all the noodles.

36:06.880 --> 36:07.950
Are you gonna lead me or not?

36:07.950 --> 36:08.840
I'll lead you.

36:13.030 --> 36:14.210
But honestly,

36:16.150 --> 36:17.390
I've never really been interested

36:17.390 --> 36:18.310
in this world.

36:19.680 --> 36:21.680
I never had much hope for the future.

36:24.800 --> 36:26.860
Everything just felt kind of boring.

36:28.840 --> 36:29.630
But

36:31.360 --> 36:31.950
now that

36:31.950 --> 36:33.150
you're with me,

36:34.110 --> 36:36.110
every time I think about the future,

36:38.800 --> 36:40.400
I actually find it exciting.

36:42.400 --> 36:43.150
I never make promises

36:43.150 --> 36:44.110
or talk about

36:45.030 --> 36:46.030
"forever"

36:46.680 --> 36:47.430
with anyone.

36:49.030 --> 36:49.950
But this time,

36:55.840 --> 36:57.570
I really want to say this to you:

36:58.840 --> 36:59.550
Zhou Wan,

37:01.110 --> 37:02.510
let's spend every summer

37:02.760 --> 37:03.960
together from now on.

37:10.470 --> 37:11.200
Okay?

37:12.990 --> 37:14.430
Winter too.

37:14.950 --> 37:16.180
-You scared me.
-Spring, summer, fall, and winter.

37:16.180 --> 37:18.310
I thought you weren't going to say yes.

37:44.850 --> 37:46.080
[Top Student Practice Book]

37:46.030 --> 37:46.920
The admission score for art school

37:46.920 --> 37:47.720
isn't that high.

37:47.720 --> 37:48.630
Why are you using

37:48.630 --> 37:49.760
such hard problems?

37:49.920 --> 37:51.550
I'm setting the bar higher

37:51.550 --> 37:54.010
so I'll be more prepared
when the time comes.

37:54.430 --> 37:56.630
I can't end up being your junior, right?

37:56.720 --> 37:57.200
I was your teacher,

37:57.200 --> 37:58.470
wasn't I?

37:59.430 --> 38:00.490
That's different.

38:00.760 --> 38:01.890
How is it different?

38:03.720 --> 38:05.070
We're different.

38:05.680 --> 38:06.800
Behave yourself.

38:08.430 --> 38:10.230
If I make progress in my studies,

38:10.280 --> 38:11.880
I deserve a reward, don't I?

38:12.400 --> 38:13.530
What kind of reward?

38:16.130 --> 38:19.230
[42 Sets of Cloze Tests
for Gaokao English]

38:18.410 --> 38:19.920
If I improve my scores,

38:19.250 --> 38:21.600
[5-Year Gaokao, 3-Year Simulation]

38:20.710 --> 38:21.970
you'll have to kiss me.

38:23.320 --> 38:24.630
We're in a bookstore.

38:25.840 --> 38:26.760
Go away.

38:27.200 --> 38:28.330
Read your own books.

38:45.950 --> 38:46.550
Hello?

38:47.030 --> 38:47.890
Hello, Xixiao.

38:48.290 --> 38:49.290
Where are you?

38:49.920 --> 38:51.910
I'm at the bookstore.

38:52.110 --> 38:53.800
I'm with Zhou Wan, picking up

38:53.800 --> 38:55.260
some books for the retake.

38:55.470 --> 38:56.030
Wait,

38:56.360 --> 38:58.220
are you really retaking the exam?

39:01.070 --> 39:01.840
What?

39:02.510 --> 39:03.200
Why?

39:03.200 --> 39:04.470
You don't have to.

39:04.720 --> 39:05.880
Just wait for the heat to die down.

39:05.880 --> 39:07.140
No matter where you want to go,

39:07.140 --> 39:08.640
art school or auto repair,

39:08.720 --> 39:09.470
your old man can

39:09.470 --> 39:10.670
pull strings for you.

39:11.800 --> 39:12.550
It's because I don't

39:12.550 --> 39:14.200
just want to date her.

39:15.630 --> 39:17.100
I want to stay by her side

39:17.510 --> 39:18.640
and take care of her.

39:20.450 --> 39:23.680
[The microphone is on.]
[Hang up] [The speaker is on.]

39:25.030 --> 39:25.630
That way,

39:25.630 --> 39:26.720
our lives stay on

39:26.720 --> 39:27.760
the same track.

39:28.880 --> 39:31.920
I actually want to

39:30.510 --> 39:36.150
[The microphone is on.]
[Hang up] [The speaker is on.]

39:33.070 --> 39:34.280
be with her, for real.

39:35.030 --> 39:35.960
You understand?

39:37.030 --> 39:38.420
Of course I do.

39:38.920 --> 39:39.990
I know Zhou Wan is special,

39:39.990 --> 39:41.650
and I know you really like her.

39:42.400 --> 39:43.930
What's that saying online?

39:44.360 --> 39:45.680
"When a man falls in love..."

39:45.680 --> 39:46.760
He has a wild heart.

39:46.840 --> 39:47.760
Can he really settle down

39:47.760 --> 39:49.020
and study for a retake?

39:49.070 --> 39:49.840
Yes.

39:50.110 --> 39:51.440
He already promised me.

39:51.720 --> 39:52.760
He may not look it,

39:53.030 --> 39:53.680
but he's actually

39:53.680 --> 39:54.510
the most devoted person.

39:54.510 --> 39:55.320
Once he sets his mind on something,

39:55.320 --> 39:56.380
that's it for life.

39:57.590 --> 39:58.510
What does devotion have

39:58.510 --> 39:59.320
to do with studying,

39:59.320 --> 40:00.060
right?

40:00.880 --> 40:01.510
He never had anyone

40:01.510 --> 40:02.550
in his heart before.

40:02.550 --> 40:03.430
Now he has Zhou Wan.

40:03.430 --> 40:04.550
Everything is different.

40:04.550 --> 40:05.240
He told me

40:05.280 --> 40:06.680
he's going to study hard

40:05.390 --> 40:08.720
[The microphone is on.]
[Hang up] [The speaker is on.]

40:06.680 --> 40:07.280
and go to college

40:07.280 --> 40:08.540
in the same city as her.

40:09.110 --> 40:10.200
He never had a mom,

40:10.200 --> 40:10.800
and he's cut ties

40:10.800 --> 40:12.030
with his dad.

40:12.240 --> 40:13.030
I used to not be able to

40:13.030 --> 40:14.030
talk some sense into him.

40:14.030 --> 40:14.990
But hearing

40:14.990 --> 40:15.760
his plan now,

40:15.950 --> 40:17.150
I think it's great.

40:17.360 --> 40:18.430
So, miss,

40:18.760 --> 40:19.590
you have to

40:19.760 --> 40:21.110
be good to him.

40:21.760 --> 40:23.200
I'm on the phone with my bestie.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.200
Stop butting in.

40:25.470 --> 40:26.430
They're together.

40:26.430 --> 40:27.760
You two are here in the store.

40:27.760 --> 40:29.760
Can't you just talk on the same call?

40:39.180 --> 40:43.250
[The microphone is on.]
[Hang up] [The speaker is on.]

40:43.550 --> 40:44.680
This is our puppy.

40:44.680 --> 40:46.320
Zhou Xiaoliu.

40:46.630 --> 40:47.240
See?

40:47.400 --> 40:51.270
[The microphone is on.]
[Hang up] [The speaker is on.]

40:47.630 --> 40:48.630
Xiaoliu.

40:49.070 --> 40:49.920
Hello.

40:51.430 --> 40:52.430
Handsome, isn't he?

40:52.430 --> 40:53.430
Handsome, right?

40:54.920 --> 40:55.800
This one's a girl.

40:55.800 --> 40:57.430
This one's a girl. Pretty, right?

40:56.340 --> 40:57.800
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

40:57.430 --> 40:58.290
Pretty, right?

40:58.550 --> 40:59.400
Pretty, right?

40:59.400 --> 41:01.190
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

41:04.290 --> 41:05.810
♪ I think you would understand ♪

41:07.330 --> 41:10.000
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

41:12.220 --> 41:14.160
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

41:13.110 --> 41:13.920
Show me yours first.

41:13.920 --> 41:14.720
Let me see yours first.

41:14.720 --> 41:15.280
Show me yours first.

41:15.280 --> 41:15.800
Let me see yours first.

41:15.530 --> 41:18.090
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

41:15.800 --> 41:16.320
I see yours first.

41:16.320 --> 41:17.910
You see mine...

41:18.280 --> 41:20.240
Show me yours first.

41:19.210 --> 41:21.800
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

41:22.890 --> 41:24.630
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

41:28.290 --> 41:29.850
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

41:31.770 --> 41:33.200
♪ An astronomer ♪

41:33.320 --> 41:35.330
Show me yours first.

41:36.230 --> 41:37.900
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

41:39.710 --> 41:42.160
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

41:40.280 --> 41:41.140
How about this?

41:42.280 --> 41:43.480
Let's count to three.

41:43.720 --> 41:45.430
Three, two, one.

41:44.260 --> 41:46.140
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

41:47.760 --> 41:49.950
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

41:51.280 --> 41:53.810
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

41:55.200 --> 41:59.000
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

42:02.100 --> 42:03.530
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

42:04.190 --> 42:05.740
♪ No time left, so I ♪

42:06.180 --> 42:08.300
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

42:10.160 --> 42:12.850
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

42:13.010 --> 42:16.440
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

42:18.290 --> 42:20.820
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

42:20.870 --> 42:24.550
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

42:26.440 --> 42:27.560
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

42:27.660 --> 42:30.400
♪ This mud all over me ♪

42:30.030 --> 42:31.240
What a coincidence.

42:31.420 --> 42:34.190
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

42:32.470 --> 42:34.470
Do you know what I was going to give you?

42:34.470 --> 42:35.280
Of course not.

42:35.280 --> 42:36.400
Do you know what I was going to give you?

42:36.400 --> 42:38.240
-Of course I don't.
-Then why?

42:39.110 --> 42:39.920
I get it.

42:40.280 --> 42:41.720
Because this is just...

42:42.240 --> 42:44.240
Meant to be.
